1.Input a year and find whether it is a leap year or not.


======================================================================================================================================================================
Answer :-

START
    READ year
    IF year MOD 4 == 0 THEN
        IF year MOD 100 == 0 THEN
            IF year MOD 400 == 0 THEN
                PRINT "Leap Year"
            ELSE
                PRINT "Not a Leap Year"
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            PRINT "Leap Year"
        ENDIF
    ELSE
        PRINT "Not a Leap Year"
    ENDIF
END

