3.Take a number as input and print the multiplication table for it.

=====================================================================================================================================================================
Answer :-
START
    READ num
    FOR i FROM 1 TO 10 DO
        product = num * i
        PRINT num + " x " + i + " = " + product
    ENDFOR
END
